        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3922750/extras/3d3b9fe79c4ca56d8a406f019f24266b.avif?t=1764204979\" width=616 height=72 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Asami Nagai and Tsubaki Utsugi have husbands and reputations to maintain. But they also have debts, and women with debts turn to the shadowy organization Ubai. Working for Ubai brings in the kind of cash one would never make in a normal job, but the work is unsavory—and illegal at that. How much of their selves are Asami and Tsubaki willing to sacrifice? Are they willing to steal from others to clear their debts?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3922750/extras/7cd0f5e50e28ef45060312703eb314ae.avif?t=1764204979\" width=616 height=73 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take your pick between following Asami or Tsubaki in this exciting visual novel. Skip text you've already read with a handy skip button or enjoy the story with the auto button. Choose your story with differing endings and unveil how their story concludes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3922750/extras/ce4dd2baed838cba04699cc4d4916d2c.avif?t=1764204979\" width=616 height=73 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3922750/extras/a2a2f2db0ef08b2d06f5a1c8f73cc34e.avif?t=1764204979\" width=616 height=275 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3922750/extras/37c8e00eac431cd552840ff46f2a9cdc.avif